abstract: "A metadata-sanitized 32-record workbook with unchanged cell values and reproducible calculations comparing highest recorded magnetic values with nearest recorded distance for operational chemical targets. This companion data/code release includes cutoff-tie enumeration, candidate-omission checks, fraction attribution, and supplementary finite-table analyses."
keywords:
  - environmental monitoring
  - sample prioritization
  - copper
  - operational extraction fractions
  - reproducibility
